# Model weights, extracted extension refs, result cache: all reproducible, never committed.
cache/
# Machine-local settings (for example the path to the extension clone).
bench.local.json
*.tmp.*
# Run outputs and the costly job caches (results, metrics, reports, model answers, paid replies):
